# Project: Apex QA Ecosystem (Toolshop LangGraph Agent)

## Architecture & Folder Structure
- Keep manual/graph.py, manual/state.py, manual/prompt.py as single files
- Keep each node or agent under manual/nodes/agent_name.py
- Keep different folders for manual and automation

## DOM Compression Rules (No LLM)
- Do NOT use an LLM for HTML compression; use deterministic Python (`BeautifulSoup`).


## LangGraph & Coding Standards
- Use LangGraph `StateGraph` with explicit `TypedDict` state definitions from `manual/state.py`.
- Keep all LLM system/user prompt templates strictly inside `manual/prompt.py`.
- In generated Playwright code (JavaScript), prioritize `[data-test="..."]` locators over CSS classes
